          "id": 414712451,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Good catch. I was going through the motions of TCP/UDP/SCTP's port handling and forgot the 8-bit types/codes in ICMP/ICMPv6. Do you want a follow-up MR? And, can I see the coverity results somewhere?",
